   - Was the $4,400 Navient figure interest you paid in 2024, or is that total interest paid in earlier years? Only 2024 interest is deductible on the 2024 return.
   - Are the $890 unreimbursed expenses employee expenses (from your W‑2 job) or business expenses related to the web‑design work?
   - Do you have any other itemizable items (mortgage interest, property tax, state/local taxes paid beyond withholding, big medical expenses)?
2. Decide home office method:
