4. Does your spouse have any income, deductions, or notable items I should include (you said married filing jointly)?
5. Are the $890 “unreimbursed expenses” business expenses related to the web-design work (supplies, software, travel, etc.)?

If you confirm those items I can
- produce a one-page numeric worksheet you can attach to your tax records showing exactly what to enter on Schedule C, Form 8829, Schedule SE, and Form 1040; and
