How each item is normally treated
1) Self-employment (web design)
- Report on Schedule C (Form 1040). Gross receipts = $8,900.
- Deduct ordinary and necessary business expenses on Schedule C (including business-related portion of rent/ utilities through the home-office deduction and the $890 if those are business expenses).
- Net profit from Schedule C is subject to income tax and self-employment (SE) tax.
