8) Possible 20% QBI deduction
- If your web‑design activity qualifies as a trade or business, you may be eligible for the Qualified Business Income (QBI) deduction (up to 20% of qualified business income) computed on Form 8995 (or 8995‑A if more complex). With relatively small net profit ($8,900 gross less expenses), you may get a small QBI deduction. It’s calculated after Schedule C net income and has phase‑ins/limits based on taxable income.

9) Forms you will likely need
- Form 1040 (U.S. Individual Income Tax Return)
- Schedule 1 (if you have adjustments like half SE tax)
