- 1099s / 1099‑NEC / 1099‑MISC / 1099‑INT / 1099‑DIV / 1099‑B from banks and brokerages — use these to complete interest/dividend/capital gain reporting. Form 8949 and Schedule D if you have broker transactions to report.
- Illinois state return (IL‑1040) for state income taxes.

10) Recordkeeping checklist (what to gather)
