- Choose home office method: given your numbers actual method produces a larger deduction (≈$5,088) but you must complete Form 8829. If you prefer simplicity, the simplified method gives $775.
- Because your itemizable deductions are low, plan to take the standard deduction unless you have additional itemizable items to add.

