- Charitable $2,000 only helps if you itemize — given the likely standard deduction for MFJ, you’ll probably take the standard deduction.
- Gather Forms 1098-E, 1099-INT, 1099-B, any 1099-NEC, W-2, rent receipts/lease, charity receipt, and business expense receipts. Consider consulting a tax preparer if you want help with Form 8829 or QBI.

